                "To institutionalize Value Innovation, enterprise marketing leaders deploy the Pioneer-Migrator-Settler (PMS) Map. Settlers are 'me-too' businesses whose value curves merely replicate industry averages, offering low growth and vulnerability to price wars. Migrators are incremental improvers that offer somewhat better value than rivals. Pioneers, however, represent true Value Innovators: businesses that command uncontested blue ocean territory, possess massive value curve divergence, and generate the lion's share of corporate revenue growth and enterprise valuation multiples.",
